--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
What was taken, and where it lives now
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Copied, with edits:

  ponytail/docs/platform-native.md
    -> knowledge/platform-native.md
    Table content retained verbatim. Added .NET/C# and Data-and-Analytics
    sections; reworded the intro to drop the persona.

Adapted:

  ponytail/skills/ponytail/SKILL.md
    -> hooks/rules.md and skills/lean-execution/SKILL.md
    The seven-rung ladder; the persistence clause; "the ladder runs after you
    understand the problem, not instead of it"; root-cause-not-symptom; the
    rules block; the output discipline; the lite/full/ultra levels; the safety
    carve-outs; the one-runnable-check rule; the shortcut-marker convention.

  ponytail/skills/ponytail-review/SKILL.md
  ponytail/skills/ponytail-audit/SKILL.md
    -> skills/lean-review/SKILL.md
    The five-tag finding grammar, the anti-example pair, the hunt list, and the
    net-lines scoring. Merged into one skill with a --repo scope flag.

  ponytail/skills/ponytail-debt/SKILL.md
    -> skills/shortcut-ledger/SKILL.md
    The grep-based harvest, the row grammar, and the no-trigger rot tag.

  ponytail/skills/ponytail-gain/SKILL.md
    -> skills/lean-execution/SKILL.md
    Only the honesty guard: never print a per-repo savings number, because the
    version that was not built has no baseline to subtract from. The benchmark
    figures were not carried over; ponytail's own README retracts them.

  ponytail/hooks/*.js
    -> hooks/context-kit.sh, hooks/context-kit.ps1
    Reimplemented in POSIX sh and PowerShell, not copied. The patterns taken
    are: fail-open on every error path; SubagentStart propagation, and its
    requirement of the hookSpecificOutput form; path sanitization before a
    shell; the once-only nudge flag; whole-message matching for deactivation
    phrases; a hardcoded fallback ruleset; and level-filtered injection.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Divergence
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This is an absorption, not a dependency. context-kit does not track ponytail
upstream and will not receive its fixes. The marker comment prefix is
`shortcut:` here, not `ponytail:`.

ponytail remains the better choice if you want the original, its multi-host
adapters, or its benchmark suite. Running both at once injects two overlapping
rulesets; pick one.

